<para>The return value must reflect the number of bytes actually transferred; a return value of -1 signals an error. Unconditionally <computeroutput>noexcept</computeroutput>, since the <computeroutput><ref refid="conceptmicro__os__plus_1_1trace_1_1detail_1_1trace__policy" kindref="compound">trace_policy</ref></computeroutput> concept already requires <computeroutput>T::write()</computeroutput> to be <computeroutput>noexcept</computeroutput>. </para>
